                     <id root="bccb859f-2a83-1bd4-e053-2a95a90a01e6"/>
                     <code code="34088-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OVERDOSAGE SECTION"/>
                     <title>Overdose warning</title>
                     <text>
                        <paragraph>Taking more than the recommended dose (overdose) may cause liver damage. In case of overdose, get medical help or contact a Poison Control Center right away (1-800-222-1222). Quick medical attention is critical for adults as well as for children even if you do not notice any signs or symptoms.</paragraph>
                     </text>
                     <effectiveTime value="20141025"/>
                  </section>
               </component>
            </section>
